  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2ce339c89c788e74ebfb2e6ed570821c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Masks
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueStrings:
  - In the midst of a chaotic convenience store, an old lady's outburst sparked a
    chain reaction of violence
  - nornHi I'm Mike, fueled by rage, reached for their AK47, intent on going on a
    kamikaze mission to take out everyone
  - " However, \u0418\u043C\u044F (nornHi I'm Mike) was swiftly taken down by an
    unknown assailant"
  - ' But, in a shocking twist, they revived themselves and stumbled upon a time
    machine'
  - " \u0418\u043C\u044F, armed with an AA-12, caught wind of the commotion and charged
    into the store"
  - "They unloaded 20, 12-gauge rounds into \u0418\u043C\u044F's heart, leaving them
    demoralized. But, in their haste, \u0418\u043C\u044F was caught and met their
    demise at the hands of a Makarov-wielding foe"
  - "Meanwhile, JNORN approached \u0418\u043C\u044F with a seemingly friendly demeanor,
    only to sock them in the mouth with a concise blow, knocking them out cold."
  - "However, this brief respite was short-lived, as \u0418\u043C\u044F soon revived
    once more."
  - "BNORN, determined to put an end to the chaos, utilized their time machine to
    travel back to \u0418\u043C\u044F's birth."
  - "With the power of Aayush's music, they successfully assassinated \u0418\u043C\u044F,
    but not before succumbing to their own demise."
  - Yet, they too revived, perpetuating the cycle of violence.
  - In the end, JNORN emerged victorious, their cunning and brute force proving to
    be the winning combination
  - ' As the dust settled, they stood alone, the last one standing in the ravaged
    convenience store.'
